  "question": {
    "text": "A particle performs linear SHM. At a particular instant, the velocity of the particle is <math><mi>u </mi></math> and acceleration is <math><mi>α</mi></math>&nbsp;(both having the same direction). At another instant velocity is <math><mi>v</mi></math> and acceleration is <math><msup><mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>β&nbsp;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;(both in opposite direction to each other).The distance between the two positions is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi> </mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi> </mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
